      explanation: "### 📖 参考答案 **Yes, because her suggestions are helpful and practical.**\n**开放题**——答 Yes 或 No 都可以，关键是**给出有说服力的理由**。\n\n### 🔎 答题思路 (How to Approach)\n- 立场：**Yes** (会采纳) 或 **No** (不会采纳)。必须**明确选一边**。\n- 理由：用 **because** 引出。理由要**扣紧 Eliza 的建议**。\n\n**可选答法**：\n- Yes 版本：\n  - Yes, because her suggestions are helpful and practical.\n  - Yes, because I have the same problem and her advice can help me.\n  - Yes, because she is experienced and her tips really work.\n- No 版本：\n  - No, because I have my own way of learning English.\n  - No, because her suggestions don't suit my situation.\n\n### 🔍 答题技巧 (Answering Tips)\n- **句型**：**Yes/No, because + 完整理由从句**。\n- 理由要**具体**：不要笼统说 \"because they are good\"——应说 because they are **helpful and practical** / **easy to follow** / **work for me**。\n- 字数：1-2 句话即可。\n\n### ⚠️ 学生常犯错误 (Common Mistakes)\n- **没有理由**：只写 \"Yes.\" —— 严重扣分。\n- **理由太空**：写成 \"Yes, because she is good.\"——没说明哪里好。\n- **没扣题**：理由与 Eliza 的建议毫无关系（如\"因为我喜欢英语\"）——不是回答原题。\n- **立场模糊**：写成 \"Maybe yes.\"——必须明确。\n\n### 🧠 一句口诀\n**立场要明确，理由扣建议**",
